{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/95569-role-of-other-mythical-supernatural-stuff","id":95569,"title":"Role of other mythical/supernatural stuff.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-03-21T06:42:18-07:00","id":95569,"title":"Role of other mythical/supernatural stuff.","content":"Is there room in the setting for, say, vampires or aliens or wizards? I think it would be fun to throw in all sorts of urban fantast stuff to go along with the mythical stuff, particuarly since I'm not too well versed in actual mythology. What says the forum?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/961-chewygranola","name":"ChewyGranola","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar961_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"254"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-21T07:05:55-07:00","id":95582,"title":"","content":"Vampires, yes. Wizards and sorcerers, hell yes, though they're more Circe and Prosperous and Paippalada. Aliens no.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Neall Raemonn Price</span><br /> Beleaguered Scion Developer</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/137-neall","name":"Neall","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar137_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1204"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-21T07:34:27-07:00","id":95612,"title":"","content":"What are some good resources for mythical kinds of things? For wizards and sorcerors and all the other supernatural crap I could use existing WoD/WitchCraft/Dresden Files books that I have.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/961-chewygranola","name":"ChewyGranola","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar961_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"254"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-21T07:35:48-07:00","id":95613,"title":"","content":"Yeah..part of a storyline...sure.<br /> <br /> As antagonists? Not so much. Unless s/he's dealing with the baddest of the bad top levelers, the moment a scion hits demigod level, s/he's probably head and shoulders above the rest of the supernatural community.<br /> I would add that some sorcerers and witches of myth likely equate to at least demigod status. Baba Yaga, V\u00e4in\u00e4m\u00f6inen, Merlin, Circe, et al, are legendary.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Mankind was once an endangered species. It will likely be so again. And mankind will only have itself to blame.</i>","edited":{"userid":144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","user":"Shadowflame","date":". 03-21-2014, 10:39 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","name":"Shadowflame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-21T08:07:07-07:00","id":95640,"title":"","content":"There are werewolf stats in the Wolfsheim adventure. I don't know how effective they will be after hero though...<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://rpg.drivethrustuff.com/product/61547/Wolfsheim-Scion\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/images/4261/61547.jpg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://rpg.drivethrustuff.com/product/61547/Wolfsheim-Scion\" target=\"_blank\"> Wolfsheim (Scion) - Onyx Path Publishing | Storytelling Adventure System | Scion | PDF Exclusives | Scion | DriveThruRPG.com </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://rpg.drivethrustuff.com/product/61547/Wolfsheim-Scion\" target=\"_blank\"> http://rpg.drivethrustuff.com/product/61547/Wolfsheim-Scion </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Wolfsheim (Scion) - A Village Lost To Fate The citizens of Wolfsheim are literally caught in the middle of a supernatural turf war between t </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Also if you want to add in aliens there is this correlation:<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Q6FV94826Ac\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Q6FV94826Ac\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Q6FV94826Ac\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Q6FV94826Ac </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Every normal man must be tempted at times to spit upon his hands, hoist the black flag, and begin slitting throats.&quot;<br /> -H.L. Mencken","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2486-irisheathen","name":"Irisheathen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2486_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-21T08:08:25-07:00","id":95642,"title":"","content":"Literally any book on mythology and folklore would provide dozens of ideas and inspirations.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm a professor! Why is no one listening to me?!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/235-telgar","name":"Telgar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar235_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2506"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-21T08:51:05-07:00","id":95678,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Telgar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/95569-role-of-other-mythical-supernatural-stuff?p=95642#post95642\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Literally any book on mythology and folklore would provide dozens of ideas and inspirations.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well I know that! I was really asking for specific recommendations of books and websites people had found useful.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/961-chewygranola","name":"ChewyGranola","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar961_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"254"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-21T12:52:12-07:00","id":95874,"title":"","content":"Just whatever Pantheon you're interested in, get a Mythology Intro for that culture. Check B&amp;N or the library.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm a professor! Why is no one listening to me?!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/235-telgar","name":"Telgar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar235_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2506"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-21T13:07:40-07:00","id":95889,"title":"","content":"World mythology is an incredibly broad topic ChewyGranola, if you have a specific culture you want to look into, I'm sure you could get more specific reading suggestions.<br /> <br /> I would highly suggest that you keep WoD stuff separate though, the cosmology is able to be forced together, but it makes everything incredibly difficult from a cosmology stance, and from a power level stance. If you would like to include Magicians, Werewolves, Fairies, and Vampires, they already have a root in mythology and you can just draw from the real mythological origins of these things.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Scion 2e Homebrew Projects:<br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1BUnAIZEDk4Zs_W0ELfffeFRAiSel3nAl/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">The \u0160iune\u0161</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1MMw0vBmHdvuGUbVhyFw7BpXT49UgECnR/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">The Enduri</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1CZuVp5VuftwuwHtzrWADqIaq7Vl-LMIr/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">The Sg\u0101\u2019na Qeda\u2019s</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/17piJ8ZBzvt4PL47vz5Gw3BF6HOZelrfh/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">The Abosom</a>, <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/282712/Lebor-Oe-In-Dea?src=newest_community\" target=\"_blank\">Lebor \u00d3e In Dea</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1rk9BKLqbUEroFDvuPSQOwp-pBRxSvN9P/view\" target=\"_blank\">The Zemi</a>, <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/324026/Nemetondevos-Revised\" target=\"_blank\">Nemetondevos: Revised</a>, and <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/325461/Mysteries-of-the-Otherworld\" target=\"_blank\">Mysteries of the Otherworld</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/394-watcher","name":"Watcher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"662"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-21T19:55:20-07:00","id":96141,"title":"","content":"I use <a href=\"http://www.pantheon.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Encyclopedia Mythica</a> when I want to explore mythology. It is not the end all, be all of online mythology, but it is a great place to start.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://www.pantheon.org/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://pantheon.org/static/img/em.png\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.pantheon.org/\" target=\"_blank\"> Encyclopedia Mythica </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.pantheon.org/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.pantheon.org/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Encyclopedia Mythica is the premier encyclopedia on mythology, folklore, and religion. Instant mythology since 1995. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>I game. This is the way.</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","us